      "title": "01 · An ordinary father",
      "summary": "Modern everyday clothes, familiar family life, then an unexpected crossing. Outfit and cinematic work are planning notes."
    },
    {
      "id": "grandstone",
      "title": "02 · The doors of Grandstone",
      "summary": "Meet the gatekeeper, inspect the oath stone, and return for the dwarves’ welcome."
    },
    {
      "id": "knight",
      "title": "03 · An oath and armor",
      "summary": "Later hero production milestone: keep the same face/body and equip modular knight armor. This beat does not change the model in game."
